    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Project Support Bot\r\n\r\nUse this bot to make sense of your capstone project as it evolves. It can help you understand milestone goals, benchmark expectations, and rubric language, and support you in deciding what matters most right now.\r\n\r\nThis bot does **not** manage your task list or schedule. You should use your Project Planning Board to track and organize tasks. Use this chat to reflect, prioritize, and make intentional decisions about your project.\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n> I’m not sure what I should be focusing on right now for this milestone. Can you help me interpret the goal and decide what matters most?\r\n\r\n> Here’s where I think I am in my project: [describe briefly]. Can you help me reflect on what would be a good next focus?\r\n\r\n> I’m feeling unsure whether my work so far really meets this milestone’s goal. Can you help me check my understanding?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
